# Pinned poetaster/arduinoMI library commits (MIT licensed) that CI fetches at
# build time for the Mutable Instruments ports: the Tiny Tides Rack module
# (rack-plugins/src/mod2-tides.cpp) and the mod2-tides / mod2-braids firmwares.
#
# The repo deliberately does NOT vendor these libraries (see CLAUDE.md); this
# file is the single source of truth for the exact upstream commits CI builds
# against. Sourced as shell by _rack.yml and _firmware.yml. To move to newer
# upstream commits, test locally first (README.md "MOD2 Braids / Tides") and
# update the SHAs here.
MI_STMLIB_SHA=c6710ca78524afcef79b1a5a98b85611b0d7c2b4
MI_TIDES_SHA=eecaea522a24fc480e92d03ae050d4fee105301c
MI_BRAIDS_SHA=298a4de33be274911649f4eb151d3596cfe428c8
